{"author": "pgaudet", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete [regulation of Rho-dependent protein serine/threonine kinase activity](http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_2000298) and GO:2000299 negative regulation of Rho-dependent protein serine/threonine kinase activity see https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/21233#issuecomment-3645989785\n\nThere is one remaining annotation to this term: \n\nRGD RGD:621007 Dab2 PMID:9681506 GO:2000298 regulation of Rho-dependent protein serine/threonine kinase activity IDA RGD:621007 PANTHER:PTHR47695 20130514 NCBITaxon:10116\n\n\nThanks, \n\nPascale", "created_at": "2025-12-15T09:31:04Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to   GO:2000299 regulation of Rho-dependent protein serine/threonine kinase activity ", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2025-12-15T19:21:03Z"}
